PMID:34358838,PubMed,34358838,Effects of probiotics on body adiposity and cardiovascular risk markers in individuals with overweight and obesity: A systematic review and meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials.,weight,"Thus, this systematic review and meta-analysis aimed to evaluate the effects of probiotic supplementation on body weight, body adiposity and CVD risk markers in overweight and obese subjects.; A systematic search for RCTs published up to December 2020 was conducted in MEDLINE (via PubMed), EMBASE, Scopus and LILACS.",P < 0.0001; P = 0.0001; P = 0.0004; P = 0.010; P = 0.003; P = 0.006,,,,,,,n = 1720,detail_hint,expansion2_queue,pending,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
PMID:34358838,PubMed,34358838,Effects of probiotics on body adiposity and cardiovascular risk markers in individuals with overweight and obesity: A systematic review and meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials.,BMI,"Data pooling showed a significant effect of probiotics in reducing body weight (MD:-0.70 kg; 95%CI:-1.04,-0.35 kg; P < 0.0001), body mass index (BMI) (MD:-0.24 kg/m2; 95%CI:-0.35,-0.12 kg/m2; P = 0.0001), waist circumference (WC) (MD:-1.13 cm; 95%CI:-1.54,-0.73 cm; P < 0.0001), fat mass (MD:-0.71 kg; 95%CI:-1.10,-0.32 kg; P = 0.0004), tumor necrosis factor-α (MD:-0.16 pg/ml; 95%CI:-0.24,-0.08 pg/ml; P = 0.0001), insulin (MD:-0.85mcU/ml; 95%CI:-1.50,-0.21mcU/ml; P = 0.010), total cholesterol (MD:",P < 0.0001; P = 0.0001; P = 0.0004; P = 0.010; P = 0.003; P = 0.006,,,,,,,n = 1720,detail_hint,expansion2_queue,pending,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
